 the points\n\n$$\n(-4,1),\\,(4,-1).\n$$\n\nWe evaluate $f$ at each of these points. These are given in the following table:\n\n| $(x,y)$ | $(-4,1)$ | $(4,-1)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $f(x,y)$ | $-35$ | $35$ |\n\n \n\nTherefore, the function reaches a maximum value at $(4,-1),$ and its maximum value is $35.$" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382233 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382234 13194139536071 true] [17592186382233 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382235 13194139536071 true] [17592186382233 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382236 13194139536071 true] [17592186382233 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382237 13194139536071 true] [17592186382233 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382238 13194139536071 true] [17592186382233 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536071 true] [17592186382233 1041 "selection" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382233 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382236 13194139536071 true] [17592186382233 1110 #uuid "1392c3f0-adcf-5145-b04a-0551ef88ee04" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382234 1034 "\\sqrt{5}" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382234 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536071 true] [17592186382234 1111 #uuid "33ccfa56-93e4-5f3f-9039-c657159e4a86" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382235 1034 "\\sqrt{35}" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382235 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536071 true] [17592186382235 1111 #uuid "c946b093-0105-55e2-9365-af82752ffc5e" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382236 1034 "35" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382236 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536071 true] [17592186382236 1111 #uuid "d2f41701-52ac-5fc1-b030-719c0556544a" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382237 1034 "4\\sqrt{5}" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382237 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536071 true] [17592186382237 1111 #uuid "9539d8e3-492b-52ae-bde8-7f35b22633a5" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382238 1034 "5" 13194139536071 true] [17592186382238 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536071 true] [17592186382238 1111 #uuid "005b56be-cae0-5963-ab0e-ee88339e5f85" 13194139536071 true]] :edb/tempids {"q-162780" 17592186382148 